5. STASHING (SAVING TEMPORARY WORK)
================================================================================
Use this when you need to switch branches quickly without committing unfinished work.

# Save unfinished changes to stash
git stash save "WIP: login page styling"

# List all saved stashes
git stash list

# Re-apply the most recent stash and remove it from stash list
git stash pop

# Re-apply a specific stash without deleting it from stash list
git stash apply stash@{0}

# Delete all stashes
git stash clear


