8. HELPFUL INSPECTION & HISTORY COMMANDS
================================================================================

# View concise commit history
git log --oneline

# View visual branch graph
git log --oneline --graph --all

# List all local branches
git branch

# List all local and remote branches
git branch -a

# Delete a local branch after merging
git branch -d feature/add-login-page

# Force-delete an unmerged branch (CAUTION)
git branch -D feature/add-login-page

# Delete a remote branch on GitHub
git push origin --delete feature/add-login-page

# Check details of remote links
git remote -v